          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana Malemba gakuti uli? Gakuti, “Mumtopole kapolojo pampepe ni mwanace jwakwe kuti mwanace jwa kapolojo akaŵa soni jwakujigala yipanje pamo ni mwanace jwa jwamkongwe jwali mlukosyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
